Z||000000||tgowens||07-30-2000||06:03 AM||||Wow! up to 1256 members now!! Welcome to those of you who have joined in the last couple of days while some of us were at the FOCOA Annual Fiero Festival........<P>Cliff, the forum is growing and we owe you many thanks for continuing it. You will be happy to know that there were many of the Forum members at the FOCOA show this weekend - many had the Pennock's Forum banner on display somewhere - from Phil with a 5 1/2 x 8 inch copy of the banner on the antenna of his yellow '88 Formula to many of us with a copy in our rear window or a few of us (87ECO5, 88GT, Old Lar and myself) with Pennock's name badges that we had made. It was great meeting many of the people we talk to on here all the time.........<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/MY_SIGNATURE.gif">               <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A>||||reg||1
